  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Items_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Localization::UnityEngine.Localization.Tables.StringTable
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 72df8041cb1f65b40958c98981ef1561, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items:
    - rid: 937747718553469026
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 1898613006336
    m_Localized: No Room For Error
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2067794452480
    m_Localized: Deal an absurd amount of damage, but a single hit could be your undoing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70567816814592
    m_Localized: Large Health Up
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70680580677632
    m_Localized: Restore {health} HP.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 937747718553469026
  - m_Id: 71017257459712
    m_Localized: Random Teleport
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 71319167655936
    m_Localized: Wanna gamble? Teleport to a random spot, even inside the danger zone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 71503196938240
    m_Localized: Weapon - Machine Gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 71606984990720
    m_Localized: Weapon with a much higher rate of fire but much lower damage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73022222852096
    m_Localized: Kill or die. There's no room for error...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74540846112768
    m_Localized: Flee with a lil twist. Random, actually.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 75199460892672
    m_Localized: This weapon fires fast ASF.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 75812378730496
    m_Localized: Uncommon
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 75907253886976
    m_Localized: Rare
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 75961305882624
    m_Localized: Epic
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76011700445184
    m_Localized: Unstable
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76081032290304
    m_Localized: Legendary
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 24637296295239680
    m_Localized: Missing Texture
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 24637799422976000
    m_Localized: They can't see you, you can't see them. If you already have this item, you go missing yourself... At least you'll gain speed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 24638048178757632
    m_Localized: Now no one can see you, neither can you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 24638443533852672
    m_Localized: (Un)lucky Shot
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 24639211494137856
    m_Localized: One random player among all players including you gets unlucky and takes {damage} damage out of the blue.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 937747718553469026
  - m_Id: 24639686226436096
    m_Localized: One got unlucky and took damage, all 'cause of you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 24646271011086336
    m_Localized: Twin Barrel
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 24646440532271104
    m_Localized: Weapon that fires 2 exploding projectiles. Ideal for small distances.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 24647016879972352
    m_Localized: Get a big gun, big damage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 25105894847504384
    m_Localized: Small Health Up
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 25106182220242944
    m_Localized: Restore {health} HP.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 937747718553469026
  - m_Id: 25157885992853504
    m_Localized: Jar O' Gunpowder
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 25158317096001536
    m_Localized: Deal more damage, more gunpowder!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 25158649037414400
    m_Localized: Heavy Treads
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 25158904093040640
    m_Localized: Become heavier but more protected. Heavier doesn't mean fatter, right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 25362945230200832
    m_Localized: Rapid Loader
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 25372714284310528
    m_Localized: Beeswax Armor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 25372870668935168
    m_Localized: Temporary gain enough defense and speed to demolish everyone on the map.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 25373363868753920
    m_Localized: Gain enough defense and speed to destroy everyone. It all begins now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 25751314284109824
    m_Localized: Bloodlust
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 25751396253392896
    m_Localized: For each {interval} missing HP, you gain {damage} damage. But this item may be picked up only once, otherwise you'll die.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 937747718553469026
  - m_Id: 25753328636354560
    m_Localized: Deal more damage as you lose HP.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26193936811253760
    m_Localized: Bomb Launcher
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26194437552431104
    m_Localized: Weapon that fires a bomb. When collision occurs, the bomb detonates launching a ton of shards around. Each shard deal small damage. This weapon may be fired only once.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26196113726332928
    m_Localized: Fire once, but any collision will cause an explosion.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26441192122572800
    m_Localized: Freezing Gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26441382044852224
    m_Localized: This weapon doesn't deal damage, but when it hits a player, it significantly drops the speed and the rate of fire of the player for a couple of seconds. This weapon may be fired only once.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26442908607930368
    m_Localized: Deal no damage, but freeze whoever you hit one time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26924141402087424
    m_Localized: True Balance?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26924559217680384
    m_Localized: Every time you fire a weapon, every player but you gains {heal} HP. Players that have this item are not affected. Your rate of fire is doubled, make sure you deal more damage than you miss.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 937747718553469026
  - m_Id: 26926915934183424
    m_Localized: Others heal as you fire, but you fire faster.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27916745065324544
    m_Localized: You restored a large amount of HP!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27916975806570496
    m_Localized: You restored a little HP!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27918120339857408
    m_Localized: 'Fire weapons a lil'' faster. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27924629891276800
    m_Localized: You picked up {item}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 937747718553469026
  - m_Id: 27924629891276801
    m_Localized: picked up
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 34421328096747520
    m_Localized: Pillow Protection
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 34421328138690560
    m_Localized: Not an airbag, but still useful.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 34421328138690561
    m_Localized: Slightly gain defense,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 34421328138690562
    m_Localized: Slippery Soap
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 34421328138690563
    m_Localized: Trust me, you will feel the effect when you drive forward and shoot backwards.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 34421328138690564
    m_Localized: Gain speed but lose resistance
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 34421328138690565
    m_Localized: Rusty Part
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 34421328138690566
    m_Localized: Despite its rust, you will deal more damage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 34421328138690567
    m_Localized: Deal slightly more damage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 34421328138690571
    m_Localized: Burst of Adrenaline
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 34421328138690572
    m_Localized: When below {health-threshold} HP, gain speed and rate of fire for {duration} seconds. Works only once per round.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 937747718553469026
  - m_Id: 34421328138690573
    m_Localized: Flee or fight on the verge of death.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 34421328138690574
    m_Localized: Re-ReRoll
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 34421328138690575
    m_Localized: This thing shuffles your stats every {interval} seconds. Stats with a value of zero are ignored and not affected. Some stats might hit their cap.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 937747718553469026
  - m_Id: 34421328138690576
    m_Localized: Now your stats have a life on their own.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 34446604776202240
    m_Localized: Stats Light
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 34446604822339584
    m_Localized: Every {interval} seconds, your stats increase one by one. Only one stat can be affected at a time, previous stats get back to normal. Once it passes the last stat, the cycle repeats from the first stat.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 937747718553469026
  - m_Id: 34446604822339585
    m_Localized: Even stats tailor for the traffic.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 34446604822339586
    m_Localized: DNA Reconstruction
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 34446604822339587
    m_Localized: 'Boosts one random stat and weakens another.


      Damage, speed and rate of fire: {damage-boost} / {damage-penalty}.

      Defense: +{defense-boost} / {defense-penalty}.

      Resistance: +{resistance-boost} / {resistance-penalty}.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 937747718553469026
  - m_Id: 34446604822339588
    m_Localized: Evolution comes at a price.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
